msgstr "钩子已写入，但此转发器未使用 --report-rpc 运行，因此无法转发智能体报告。请使用 --report-rpc 启动它，以便在按键上显示此电脑的智能体。"

#: polyhost/forwarder.py:559
msgid "The hooks are written. On the keyboard computer, turn on Settings > AI agents > \"Agents from other computers\"."
msgstr "钩子已写入。请在键盘所在的电脑上打开 设置 > AI 智能体 > “来自其他电脑的智能体”。"

#: polyhost/forwarder.py:890
msgid "PolyForwarder settings"
msgstr "PolyForwarder 设置"

#: polyhost/forwarder.py:891
msgid "The settings could not be saved to the settings file, so they will not take effect. Another program may be holding it open. Try again, or see the log."
msgstr "设置无法保存到设置文件，因此不会生效。可能有其他程序正在占用该文件。请重试，或查看日志。"

#: polyhost/forwarder.py:909
msgid "Paired. The forwarder uses the authenticated connection from its next start. Restart it now?"
msgstr "已配对。转发器从下次启动起使用经过身份验证的连接。立即重新启动吗？"

#: polyhost/forwarder.py:924
#, python-brace-format
msgid "authenticated RPC (port {port})"
msgstr "经过身份验证的 RPC（端口 {port}）"

#: polyhost/forwarder.py:926
msgid "legacy plaintext TCP relay"
msgstr "旧版明文 TCP 中继"

#: polyhost/forwarder.py:929
msgid "reaching the keyboard machine"
msgstr "可连接到键盘所在的电脑"

#: polyhost/forwarder.py:930
msgid "not reaching the keyboard machine"
msgstr "无法连接到键盘所在的电脑"

#: polyhost/forwarder.py:931
msgid "starting up"
msgstr "正在启动"

#: polyhost/forwarder.py:933
msgid "<b>Mode:</b> forwarder — no keyboard attached to this machine"
msgstr "<b>模式：</b>转发器 — 本机未连接键盘"

#: polyhost/forwarder.py:934
#, python-brace-format
msgid "<b>Target:</b> {target}"
msgstr "<b>目标：</b>{target}"

#: polyhost/forwarder.py:936
#, python-brace-format
msgid "<b>Window reports:</b> {transport}"
msgstr "<b>窗口报告：</b>{transport}"

#: polyhost/forwarder.py:939
#, python-brace-format
